  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&rArr;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Tangents are drawn at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, on plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/132fcf6d-2971-4341-bfe5-64ea0f7c71ce-image.png\" style=\"width: 311px; height: 200px;\" />​​​​​​​</p><p>Now, tangent as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;{using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>}</p><p>Intersection with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence, point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We can see diagram has&nbsp;symmetry</p><p>So, area of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∆</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&times;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&times;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&times;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>sq</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>units</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
